Hi {!Case.Contact},

Here are a few quick steps for viewing and printing receipts for reimbursement.

1. Log into your EverQuote Pro account. (pro.everquote.com/login) 
2. Click 'Account' in the top right of the page, and then 'Payment' on the drop-down menu. 
3. On this page you will see 'Summary Report'. 
4. Select which month you wish to view and click 'Download'.

The summary will then automatically download and be viewable and printable via your browser. The current month will not be accessible until the 1st of the following month.

If you have any other questions or concerns, feel free to reach out to (844) 707-8800 (Option 1).

Thanks,